@AikaEngine.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health Check
GET {{AikaEngine.WebApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### List Policy Clauses
GET {{AikaEngine.WebApi_HostAddress}}/tools/policy-clauses
Accept: application/json

###

### Calculate Payout (Deterministic Rules Engine)
POST {{AikaEngine.WebApi_HostAddress}}/tools/calculate-payout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimed_amount": 850.00,
  "clause_code": "HOME_BIKE_01",
  "item_age_years": 1,
  "has_police_report": true
}

###

### Fraud Risk Check
POST {{AikaEngine.WebApi_HostAddress}}/tools/fraud-check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claimant_id": "CLM-001",
  "incident_description": "Bike stolen from backyard overnight",
  "claimed_amount": 850.00
}

###

### In-App Agent Triage (Requires server or client API key)
POST {{AikaEngine.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/agent/triage
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "claim_id": "CLM-2026-TEST",
  "claimant_id": "USR-1001",
  "category": "home",
  "incident_description": "Commuter bicycle stolen from locked yard overnight. Reported to police.",
  "claimed_amount": 750.00,
  "clause_code": "HOME_BIKE_01",
  "item_age_years": 1,
  "has_police_report": true
}

###
